            {
              "lesson_id": "comparing_cities_lesson",
              "title": "Comparatives",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "phase": "context",
                  "type": "audio_context",
                  "content": {
                    "title": "Bristol or Valencia?",
                    "dialogue": [
                      {
                        "speaker": "Javi",
                        "text": "So, which city is better, Bristol or Valencia?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "That's a difficult question! Valencia is bigger and sunnier, of course."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Javi",
                        "text": "And the food?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "The food in Valencia is better. But Bristol is more interesting than I thought. There's a lot of music and art."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Javi",
                        "text": "Is it more expensive?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "Yes, much more expensive. My rent here is higher than in Madrid."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Javi",
                        "text": "And the people? Are they friendlier than in Spain?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "They're quieter, but they're very kind. And they say \"sorry\" more often than we do!"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Javi",
                        "text": "Ha! And the weather is worse, right?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "Much worse. It's colder and wetter. But Bristol isn't as grey as people say."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Javi",
                        "text": "Good friends make it better… like the Irish guy?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "Javi! Daniel is just a friend. And he's funnier than you!"
                      }
                    ],
                    "passage": "Javi calls on Sunday. He wants to practise his English for his exam, and he has a lot of questions about Bristol."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "phase": "discovery",
                  "type": "multiple_choice",
                  "content": {
                    "instructions": "Fíjate en el diálogo y responde.",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "question": "\"Valencia is bigger.\" The comparative of big is…",
                        "options": [
                          "bigger",
                          "more big"
                        ],
                        "answer": 0
                      },
                      {
                        "question": "\"more interesting than\": with long adjectives we use…",
                        "options": [
                          "more + adjective",
                          "adjective + -er"
                        ],
                        "answer": 0
                      },
                      {
                        "question": "\"The food in Valencia is better.\" Better is the comparative of…",
                        "options": [
                          "good",
                          "bad"
                        ],
                        "answer": 0
                      },
                      {
                        "question": "For Lucía, which city is more expensive?",
                        "options": [
                          "Bristol",
                          "Valencia"
                        ],
                        "answer": 0
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "phase": "grammar",
                  "type": "grammar_rule",
                  "content": {
                    "title": "Comparatives",
                    "explanation": "Para comparar usamos el comparativo + than: Valencia is bigger than Bristol.\n\nAdjetivos cortos: + -er (small → smaller, cold → colder). Si acaban en vocal + consonante, la consonante se dobla: big → bigger, wet → wetter. Si acaban en -y: sunny → sunnier, funny → funnier, friendly → friendlier.\n\nAdjetivos largos: more / less + adjetivo: more expensive, more interesting.\n\nIrregulares: good → better, bad → worse, far → further.\n\nPara reforzar: much bigger, much more expensive. Para decir que no son iguales: Bristol isn't as sunny as Valencia.",
                    "table": {
                      "headers": [
                        "Adjetivo",
                        "Comparativo",
                        "Regla"
                      ],
                      "rows": [
                        [
                          "small",
                          "smaller",
                          "+ -er"
                        ],
                        [
                          "big",
                          "bigger",
                          "dobla la consonante"
                        ],
                        [
                          "sunny",
                          "sunnier",
                          "-y → -ier"
                        ],
                        [
                          "expensive",
                          "more expensive",
                          "more + adjetivo largo"
                        ],
                        [
                          "good",
                          "better",
                          "irregular"
                        ],
                        [
                          "bad",
                          "worse",
                          "irregular"
                        ],
                        [
                          "far",
                          "further",
                          "irregular"
                        ]
                      ]
                    },
                    "examples": [
                      "Valencia is bigger and sunnier.",
                      "Bristol is much more expensive.",
                      "The weather is worse here.",
                      "Bristol isn't as grey as people say."
                    ]
                  }
                },
